# Secrets / local env
.env

# Node
# No trailing slash on node_modules, deliberately: a trailing slash matches a
# DIRECTORY only, and CLAUDE.md tells you to symlink node_modules from another
# worktree rather than run `npm ci` (its postinstall clobbers the host's
# agent-browser). A symlink is not a directory, so `web/node_modules/` left the
# symlink untracked and one `git add -A` staged a link pointing outside the repo.
web/node_modules
web/dist/

